1
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:06,780
台北木柵　景美溪畔　一條山洞通往山谷
<i>Muzha, Taipei. By the Jingmei River, a tunnel leads into a valley.</i>

2
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:11,640
山谷裡　藏著一座專練「新聞武功」的門派
<i>Hidden in the valley is a sect that trains in the martial art of news.</i>

3
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:18,200
世新大學新聞系的武功秘笈
<i>The Secret Manual of Shih Hsin University's Department of Journalism.</i>

4
00:00:22,283 --> 00:00:27,103
1956年　報人成舍我在木柵溝子口開山立派
<i>In 1956, newspaperman Cheng She-wo founded the sect at Gouzikou, Muzha.</i>

5
00:00:28,203 --> 00:00:33,103
世界新聞職業學校開學　首批弟子只有63人
<i>The World Vocational School of Journalism opened with just 63 disciples.</i>

6
00:00:35,617 --> 00:00:39,227
他傳下總訣：德智兼修　手腦並用
<i>His creed: cultivate virtue and wisdom; use both hands and mind.</i>

7
00:00:39,927 --> 00:00:44,097
像周伯通左右互搏：腦會想　手也要會做
<i>Like Zhou Botong's two-handed combat: the mind thinks, the hands deliver.</i>

8
00:00:46,983 --> 00:00:50,913
1957年3月　實習刊物《小世界》創刊
<i>In March 1957, the student practicum paper Little World was launched.</i>

9
00:00:51,613 --> 00:00:56,223
弟子們下山採訪　編輯　印報　在江湖實戰
<i>Disciples went down the mountain to report, edit and print: real combat.</i>

10
00:00:58,717 --> 00:01:03,217
第一式　採訪：令狐沖的獨孤九劍　專找破綻
<i>Form One, Interviewing: Linghu Chong's Nine Swords of Dugu seek the flaw.</i>

11
00:01:04,717 --> 00:01:08,097
一個好問題　就能刺穿千言萬語
<i>One good question can pierce a thousand words.</i>

12
00:01:10,583 --> 00:01:14,953
第二式　寫作：喬峰的降龍十八掌　招招到位
<i>Form Two, Writing: Qiao Feng's Dragon-Subduing Palms. Every blow lands.</i>

13
00:01:16,753 --> 00:01:20,143
導言開門見山　一掌直達重點
<i>The lead goes straight to the point, one palm to the heart of it.</i>

14
00:01:22,850 --> 00:01:27,260
第三式　查證：楊過的玄鐵重劍　重劍無鋒
<i>Form Three, Verification: Yang Guo's heavy iron sword. No edge, all weight.</i>

15
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:32,660
在資訊的狂潮裡練劍　一字一句都站得穩
<i>Trained against a tide of information, every word stands firm.</i>

16
00:01:35,150 --> 00:01:38,860
第四式　編輯：張無忌的乾坤大挪移
<i>Form Four, Editing: Zhang Wuji's Great Shift of Heaven and Earth.</i>

17
00:01:40,260 --> 00:01:44,570
從鉛字排版到數位新聞　《小世界》挪移乾坤
<i>From lead type to digital news, Little World keeps reshaping itself.</i>

18
00:01:47,583 --> 00:01:50,663
郭靖說：俠之大者　為國為民
<i>Guo Jing said: the greatest heroes serve the nation and its people.</i>

19
00:01:51,663 --> 00:01:55,913
成舍我深信　健全的民主需要健全的新聞
<i>Cheng She-wo believed a sound democracy needs sound journalism.</i>

20
00:01:56,613 --> 00:02:00,043
九十歲那年　他仍創辦《台灣立報》
<i>In the year he turned ninety, he still founded the Taiwan Lihpao.</i>

21
00:02:02,550 --> 00:02:06,190
七十年來　這本秘笈一代傳過一代
<i>For seventy years, this manual has passed from generation to generation.</i>

22
00:02:07,290 --> 00:02:11,370
最後一頁永遠空白　留給下一位執筆的人
<i>Its last page is always blank, left for the next one to take up the pen.</i>

23
00:02:15,083 --> 00:02:17,713
風華七十　傳世新章
<i>Seventy radiant years; a new chapter to pass on.</i>
